      textEn: '\u2026. Query: How contrive not to waste one\'s time?Answer: By being fully aware of it all the while.Ways in which this can be done: By spending one\'s days on an uneasy chair in a dentist\'s waiting-room; by remaining on one\'s balcony all of a Sunday afternoon; by listening to lectures in a language on doesn\'t know; by traveling by the longest and least-convenient train routes, and of course standing all the way; by lining up at the box-office of theaters and then not buying a seat; and so forth.',
